  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mainstreaming the Human Security Approach by Improving Mining Sector Governance to Enhance Environment Sustainability and Resilient Livelihoods in Sierra Leone.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to promote the use of the human security approach as a tool for improved mining sector governance, including company compliance with mining and environmental regulations and mining community engagement in governance issues.</narrative>
